      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a product of \\( 2^{x} \\) and \\( \\ln\\left(2 + \\sin(3x)\\right) \\), so the product rule comes first: \\( f'(x) = \\left(2^{x}\\right)'\\,\\ln\\left(2 + \\sin(3x)\\right) + 2^{x}\\left(\\ln\\left(2 + \\sin(3x)\\right)\\right)' \\).",
