                  ]
               ],
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the product rule and evaluate at \\( x = 0 \\): \\( f'(0) = \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2} + \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
